    "name": "Spring Batch 5.1 Actuator Batch Jobs Metrics API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Spring Boot Actuator endpoints exposed by Spring Batch 5.1 applications for monitoring and managing batch jobs. Provides health checks, metrics, job execution status, and step execution details via the Spring Boot Actuator infrastructure. These endpoints are available when spring-boot-actuator is on the classpath alongside spring-batch-core.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Spring Team",
